# Copy to .secrets-denylist (git-ignored) and list anything that identifies you or your
# home but doesn't LOOK like a secret. One value per line, matched case-insensitively as
# a whole word. The pre-commit hook and CI refuse any commit that contains one.
#
# Ideas: your surname, street name, house name, town, postcode / ZIP, Wi-Fi network name,
# alarm or door codes, your public domain name, family members' names (if you'd rather
# they weren't in the repo), car registration.
#
# Smith
# Acacia Avenue
# AB1 2CD
# MyWifiName
